detaileddescription.para:
Example: for(inti=0;i<7;++i)//Canonicalloop"i"
for(intj=0;j<9;++j)//Canonicalloop"j"
body(i,j);

After collapsing with Loops={i,j}, the loop is changed to for(intij=0;ij<63;++ij){
inti=ij/9;
intj=ij%9;
body(i,j);
}

Example: for(inti=0;i<15;++i)//Canonicalloop"i"
for(intj=0;j<14;++j)//Canonicalloop"j"
body(i,j);

After tiling with Loops={i,j} and TileSizes={5,7}, the loop is changed to for(inti1=0;i1<3;++i1)
for(intj1=0;j1<2;++j1)
for(inti2=0;i2<5;++i2)
for(intj2=0;j2<7;++j2)
body(i1*3+i2,j1*3+j2);

